    "planted": "Each planted violation has one or more locations {file, lines:[from,to]} (paths relative to the fixture root) and keywords (regex, case-insensitive). A reported violation counts as a HIT for it when its file matches a location and either its line range overlaps that location (+/-1) or its text matches the keywords.",
